{
 "id": "fox-shine-knockdown",
 "name": "Shine knockdown: tech chase",
 "part": "punish",
 "characters": [
  "fox"
 ],
 "goal": "After a shine knocks the opponent down, cover its tech or its missed tech before it can act",
 "why": "Fox's shine knocks light and fast-falling opponents onto the floor. They choose there: a tech in place, a tech roll to either side, or no tech at all. Each ends somewhere else at another time; the punish is being there with a grab or a hit before they can act.",
 "switch": "every",
 "reset": {
  "after": "quiet",
  "seconds": 1
 },
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Run at the opponent and shine it. Jump out of the shine and wavedash so Fox can act early. Watch which way it goes, follow, and grab or up smash it as its tech ends.",
  "expect": "A try begins when the shine hits and is judged when Fox grabs or hits the opponent again, when it hits him, or when it stands free. It moves about until the shine catches it, and which tech it picks changes every try.",
  "example": [
   {
    "stick": [
     1,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 300
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     -1
    ],
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 3,
    "from": {
     "near": "NEAR"
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "B",
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 2,
    "from": {
     "near": "NEAR"
    }
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     0
    ],
    "frame": 3,
    "hold": 300,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": 7,
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "trigger": "R",
    "frame": "WF",
    "hold": 2,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     "WX",
     "WY"
    ],
    "frame": "WF",
    "hold": 2,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     0
    ],
    "frame": "WF+2",
    "hold": 300,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     "RUN",
     0
    ],
    "frame": "RF",
    "hold": 200,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": 1,
    "from": {
     "near": "GD",
     "after": {
      "frame": "GA"
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "Z",
    "frame": 2,
    "from": {
     "near": "GD",
     "after": {
      "frame": "GA"
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": 1,
    "from": {
     "near": "UD",
     "after": {
      "frame": "UA"
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "cstick": [
     0,
     1
    ],
    "frame": 2,
    "hold": 2,
    "from": {
     "near": "UD",
     "after": {
      "frame": "UA"
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "cstick": [
     0,
     1
    ],
    "frame": "UF",
    "hold": 2,
    "from": "start"
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: the shine. {opp} is knocked down",
   "7": "Frame {f}: X or Y out of the shine",
   "10": "Frame {f}: the wavedash: Fox can act on frame 20"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "What it can do",
    "text": [
     "Shined, {opp} meets the floor as the hit's freeze ends. A tech in place has it standing 26 frames later; a tech roll carries it to one side for 40; with no tech it bounces and lies there.",
     "A tech cannot be hit for its first 20 frames. The punish lands in what is left: 6 frames in place, 20 at the end of a roll."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "stick": [
         1,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 300
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         -1
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 3,
        "from": {
         "near": "NEAR"
        }
       },
       {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 2,
        "from": {
         "near": "NEAR"
        }
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         0,
         0
        ],
        "frame": 3,
        "hold": 300,
        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the shine. {opp} is knocked down"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "Free early, then follow",
    "text": [
     "Fox jumps out of the shine on frame 7 and wavedashes: he can act on frame 20, long before {opp} can.",
     "Then it is a matter of where: next to a tech in place, at the end of a roll, or over the one that lies on the floor, which an up smash hits but a grab does not."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
